{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>A Maze-Like Cinema</strong><br>The layout of the theater changes every time. It may look familiar, but something always feels different.<br>You\u2019re not losing your way\u2014someone might be changing the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles and Hidden Clues</strong><br>Posters, seat arrangements, even the sound of speakers can all be part of a puzzle.<br>Sharpen your observation and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Immersive Sound Design and Atmosphere</strong><br>Uneasy silence, the distant whir of a projector, and echoes in an empty auditorium\u2014<br>everything comes together to create a tense and immersive journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799310?t=1752655807","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799310?t=1752655807","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799310/fd51058026da6a01d45185fcffff920ad9054a0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752655807","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799310/fd51058026da6a01d45185fcffff920ad9054a0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752655807","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>A Maze-Like Cinema</strong><br>The layout of the theater changes every time. It may look familiar, but something always feels different.<br>You\u2019re not losing your way\u2014someone might be changing the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Environmental Puzzles and Hidden Clues</strong><br>Posters, seat arrangements, even the sound of speakers can all be part of a puzzle.<br>Sharpen your observation and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Immersive Sound